From: u368f61d9252655a2 at groups.google.com (Herra Huu)
Date: Sun, 15 Jun 2014 15:29:31 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] fit independent models in one go to assess prior influence
Message-ID: <1qamWpuk29o.AbA_1pDb-DsJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <1qamWpuk29o.ETbGJX02q0EJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
