Hi Michael,

You need to find the file "Makevars" that is in the folder ~/.R/ (where "~" is something like usr/[username]). ".R" starts with a period, so this indicates it is a hidden folder. You can't find it with finder, unless you do some tweaks. See here <http://ianlunn.co.uk/articles/quickly-showhide-hidden-files-mac-os-x-mavericks/> how to do that.

Btw, I recently got a new Macbook Pro, and I was able to successfully install rstan with CXX=clang++ in my Makevars file (and having installed inline and Rcpp from source).

Luc

