Wednesday, July 16th, 6-8 PM
Bentham House, Seminar Room 4
4-8 Endsleigh Gardens, London, WC1H 0EG

Nominally the plan is to begin with a casual introduction to Stan and then breakout
into discussion based on the interests of the attendees.  Bring statistical questions,
broken models you’d like to debug, and working models you’d like to share.

