From u368f61d9252655a2 at groups.google.com  Sat Jun 21 00:53:24 2014
From: u368f61d9252655a2 at groups.google.com (Herra Huu)
Date: Sat, 21 Jun 2014 00:53:24 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] gaussian process in stan
Message-ID: <ga4D703b9HA.Q6xcKnK2B4IJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <ga4D703b9HA.EchmsTR971cJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
