From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Mon Jun 23 17:40:43 2014
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Mon, 23 Jun 2014 17:40:43 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Seemingly Unrelated Regressions Time Series
Message-ID: <ZkAaXcT539M.ghh8cA1cfK8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <ZkAaXcT539M.Jly16NSAx0QJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <ZkAaXcT539M.RQkmTI-X3yYJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <ZkAaXcT539M.Jly16NSAx0QJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
