From ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com  Wed Jun 25 08:08:09 2014
From: ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com (Michael Betancourt)
Date: Wed, 25 Jun 2014 08:08:09 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: Model design: detect latent temporal change points in regression parameters
Message-ID: <QlgX00f6JG8.wss_v6XMXtQJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <QlgX00f6JG8.wsoZL9TxGOoJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <QlgX00f6JG8.ZmNUg7rvZEsJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <QlgX00f6JG8.wsoZL9TxGOoJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
