Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Yes, I think you've identified the problem. In the original model, you had:

>   shift <- mean(a);
>   scale <- sd(a);
>
>   a <- (a_raw - shift)/scale;
>   b <- (b_raw - shift)/scale;

The first two lines should come after the last two. Both shift and scale will be NaN at the time of evaluation in the original model.

